SEKRETSAUCE - COMPLETED FEATURES
=====================================

✅ ALL ORIGINAL TODO ITEMS COMPLETED!

BROWSER EXPORT:
---------------
✅ sekretsauce export firefox --json     (Firefox settings, bookmarks, history to JSON)
✅ sekretsauce export chrome --json      (Chrome data to JSON)
✅ sekretsauce export safari --json      (Safari support added)
✅ sekretsauce export --json             (All browsers)

SECURITY SCANNING:
------------------
✅ sekretsauce scan                      (Comprehensive full scan)
✅ sekretsauce scan keychain             (Scan macOS password system)
✅ sekretsauce scan certs                (Certificate transparency checks)
✅ sekretsauce scan hidden               (Find hidden processes & launch agents)
✅ sekretsauce scan apps                 (Inspect app bundles for security issues)
✅ sekretsauce scan breach               (Auto-flag compromised accounts)

BONUS FEATURES:
---------------
✅ sekretsauce scan secrets              (Find exposed API keys & credentials)
✅ sekretsauce scan wallets              (Find cryptocurrency wallets & seed phrases)
✅ sekretsauce scan cas                  (Audit Certificate Authorities)

OUTPUT & INTERFACE:
-------------------
✅ Beautiful formatted CLI output
✅ JSON output support (--json flag)
✅ File output support (-o flag)
✅ Verbose mode (-v flag)
✅ Full-featured CLI with tab completion
✅ SwiftUI GUI app with all scan features

ARCHITECTURE:
-------------
✅ Modular Go packages (browser, keychain, hunter, inspector, breach, etc.)
✅ Clean CLI interface using Cobra
✅ Native macOS GUI built with SwiftUI
✅ JSON-based communication between CLI and GUI

SeKretSauce is a complete swiss army knife for network and security professionals on macOS!


